    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please refer to the last page for the demo save file inheritance method (inheritance can only be performed after the February update, and the trial version will no longer be available after April 7th).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961460/extras/7051b164c586afbd29d1c424e6e54a63.webp?t=1744523168\" width=622 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ancient sacred tree rooted in the Kingdom of Karen, bestowing blessings upon people, is the faith of the entire nation. The noble royal family and the Saint Valtine Church, wielding power, are staunch supporters of the sacred tree. The story begins with the Sacred Tree Festival in the Kingdom of Karen, an annual festival. On this day, to thank the sacred tree for its blessings to Karen, the Saint Valtine Church and the nobility organize the festival and proclaim the divine revelation. After spending a few days in daily life with her sharp-tongued maid, Ela, and the yandere nun, Sissy, Hekate attends the Sacred Tree Festival with Ela. Hekate, known as the &quot;Child of the Sacred Tree,&quot; beloved by everyone around her due to her sacred tree lineage, seems poised to become an excellent paladin effortlessly. However, a major incident occurs during the Sacred Tree Festival. After this incident, the environment around Hekate undergoes a drastic change, and she herself becomes confused about her beliefs. The noble royal family, the Saint Valtine Church, and the rebellious Truth Liberation Army. In the mutual struggle of these major forces, can Hekate overcome her confusion, stand firm in her beliefs, and make choices without regrets\u2014this is the story of a girl who fights with faith even if she loses everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961460/extras/3e77b8ebc66f4c498b263176c504a843.webp?t=1744523168\" width=622 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich storyline, featuring an ultra-extended campaign with over 400,000 words of text.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961460/extras/77a2e6238f09135000f096c79fa78497.avif?t=1744523168\" width=640 height=360 /></span>\u25b3 hundreds of unique cards, and a variety of card builds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961460/extras/5e434f3715a4e0b9af8c918de0fdadf4.poster.avif?t=1744523168\" width=624 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961460/extras/5e434f3715a4e0b9af8c918de0fdadf4.webm?t=1744523168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961460/extras/5e434f3715a4e0b9af8c918de0fdadf4.mp4?t=1744523168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961460/extras/64c52aa1f98eefbffb5abddbe2ad0663.poster.avif?t=1744523168\" width=624 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961460/extras/64c52aa1f98eefbffb5abddbe2ad0663.webm?t=1744523168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961460/extras/64c52aa1f98eefbffb5abddbe2ad0663.mp4?t=1744523168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u25b3 Exquisite skeletal models and skill effects. Each card has a completely different battle performance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961460/extras/3074f39099a843fc848d68349b937d18.avif?t=1744523168\" width=640 height=360 /></span>\u25b3 Unique alchemy system. Explore maps, gather materials, obtain blueprints, and forge unique artifacts and weapons to enhance your strength!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b3 Various gameplay mechanics such as gathering, strengthening, skill trees, etc., complement each other, providing you with diverse gaming experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961460/extras/69c8b02ee882860407aabce30f8279ba.webp?t=1744523168\" width=622 height=42 /></span>30 hours and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961460/extras/f8903bbf1e0bf2b4a635024f95c544c2.avif?t=1744523168\" width=600 height=5852 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Regarding Archive Transfer\uff08</strong>The following Steam game management operations are for reference only.<strong>\uff09:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.Right-click on the demo project, select <strong>Manage</strong> \u2192 <strong>Browse Local Files</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.Open the demo version's <strong>www</strong> folder, and copy the <strong>save</strong> folder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3.Right-click on the official version project, select <strong>Manage</strong> \u2192 <strong>Browse Local Files</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4.Open the official version's <strong>www</strong> folder, and paste the copied <strong>save</strong> folder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5.Open the pasted <strong>save</strong> folder and delete the config file (&quot;Not deleting may cause some operational functions' configurations to become disordered.&quot;).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> If the cloud save of the official version has already recorded the save file, please perform the archive transfer operation when running the game.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please refer to the last page for the demo save file inheritance method (inheritance can only be performed after the February update, and the trial version will no longer be available after April 7th).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961460/extras/7051b164c586afbd29d1c424e6e54a63.webp?t=1744523168\" width=622 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ancient sacred tree rooted in the Kingdom of Karen, bestowing blessings upon people, is the faith of the entire nation. The noble royal family and the Saint Valtine Church, wielding power, are staunch supporters of the sacred tree. The story begins with the Sacred Tree Festival in the Kingdom of Karen, an annual festival. On this day, to thank the sacred tree for its blessings to Karen, the Saint Valtine Church and the nobility organize the festival and proclaim the divine revelation. After spending a few days in daily life with her sharp-tongued maid, Ela, and the yandere nun, Sissy, Hekate attends the Sacred Tree Festival with Ela. Hekate, known as the &quot;Child of the Sacred Tree,&quot; beloved by everyone around her due to her sacred tree lineage, seems poised to become an excellent paladin effortlessly. However, a major incident occurs during the Sacred Tree Festival. After this incident, the environment around Hekate undergoes a drastic change, and she herself becomes confused about her beliefs. The noble royal family, the Saint Valtine Church, and the rebellious Truth Liberation Army. In the mutual struggle of these major forces, can Hekate overcome her confusion, stand firm in her beliefs, and make choices without regrets\u2014this is the story of a girl who fights with faith even if she loses everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://sha