nt battle performance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961460/extras/3074f39099a843fc848d68349b937d18.avif?t=1744523168\" width=640 height=360 /></span>\u25b3 Unique alchemy system. Explore maps, gather materials, obtain blueprints, and forge unique artifacts and weapons to enhance your strength!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b3 Various gameplay mechanics such as gathering, strengthening, skill trees, etc., complement each other, providing you with diverse gaming experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961460/extras/69c8b02ee882860407aabce30f8279ba.webp?t=1744523168\" width=622 height=42 /></span>30 hours and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961460/extras/f8903bbf1e0bf2b4a635024f95c544c2.avif?t=1744523168\" width=600 height=5852 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Regarding Archive Transfer\uff08</strong>The following Steam game management operations are for reference only.<strong>\uff09:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.Right-click on the demo project, select <strong>Manage</strong> \u2192 <strong>Browse Local Files</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.Open the demo version's <strong>www</strong> folder, and copy the <strong>save</strong> folder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3.Right-click on the official version project, select <strong>Manage</strong> \u2192 <strong>Browse Local Files</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4.Open the official version's <strong>www</strong> folder, and paste the copied <strong>save</strong> folder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5.Open the pasted <strong>save</strong> folder and delete the config file (&quot;Not deleting may cause some operational functions' configurations to become disordered.&quot;).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> If the cloud save of the official version has already recorded the save file, please perform the archive transfer operation when running the game.</p>",
